  m_Name: MaldingMoleEnter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutSceneInfo
  dialogue:
  - Hear ye hear ye
  - There have been reports of a mole harassing the people
  - And it appears to be angry, perhaps even malding?
  - Anyhow whoever deals with it will have done me a great service, and surely your
    name will spread
  - Also I hear his stomps cause small earthquakes, maybe try jumping? Hows the earthquake
    gonna hurt you if you just jump
